    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21480" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Γᾰλάται</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾰ], οἱ,</span>
